      <activity id="e69021e8-a45b-54e5-9f23-b8adca3dde7d" activityNameId="0d77e3cf-823e-5c0d-8a34-f6ee31077428" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Butane-1,4-diol, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Butane-1,4-diol, at plant
The process "c1,4-butanediol, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of  1,4-butanediol  from acetylene in Europe.  Raw materials, Energy consumptions and emissions are modelled with literature data. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000110-63-4; 
Formula: C4H10O2; 
Synonyms: butylene glycol; 
UUID: fa38ef6e-2d70-3ebe-b490-a7549ab4328d
Production of 1,4-butanediol including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Hydrgenation of butynediol from acetylene
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports are modelled with standard distances.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_fa38ef6e-2d70-3ebe-b490-a7549ab4328d.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
